{"_id":"6a44b7c4aae59d475deb9d9a","title":"aimbot menu","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d95","gameId":286090429,"name":"Arsenal","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/bcf4cc7e44823466746f5b32b5a089e078242075e63b4abdf1e59502b6a63b63.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-29023c3f115f5eac513c836ef674fd42/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"286090429-arsenal","path":"/game/286090429-arsenal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/bcf4cc7e44823466746f5b32b5a089e078242075e63b4abdf1e59502b6a63b63.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-29023c3f115f5eac513c836ef674fd42/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":286090429},"slug":"Arsenal-aimbot-menu-240517","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":5604,"executes":3653,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9ef7462367fd3a5ee1fdbbec9ea5fd1a732e41ed438da5e29bb90345ff221dcd.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-fd5d29ef7df403915891862d02ae09bb-72a88d5afbad.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-fd5d29ef7df403915891862d02ae09bb-72a88d5afbad.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9ef7462367fd3a5ee1fdbbec9ea5fd1a732e41ed438da5e29bb90345ff221dcd.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-fd5d29ef7df403915891862d02ae09bb-72a88d5afbad.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-fd5d29ef7df403915891862d02ae09bb-72a88d5afbad.png"},"likeCount":4,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2026-07-01T06:46:28.745Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-01T06:46:28.745Z","lastBump":"2026-07-01T06:46:28.745Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://robloxscripts.com/raw/arsenal-aimbot-esp-teamcheck-wallcheck-script\"))()","features":"CRAFT V2 is a lightweight and efficient combat suite for Arsenal, designed to give you a clinical edge while maintaining a professional-looking interface. This script features a custom-built GUI with a draggable header and responsive toggles for full control over your gameplay. Please read this! To enable aimbot, you need to right-click, and teamcheck is always on\n\nKey Features: Smooth Aimbot: High-precision aiming using mousemoverel for more natural movement. Right-Click Activation: The aimbot only engages when you hold the Right Mouse Button, allowing you to choose exactly when to lock on. Advanced Wallcheck: Integrated raycasting ensures the aimbot won't lock onto players hidden behind walls or obstacles. Team Check: Automatically ignores teammates so you only track valid hostiles. Dynamic ESP: Clean bounding boxes that scale with player distance, giving you perfect situational awareness. Adjustable FOV: A visual circle shows your aim zone; only targets inside this circle are tracked. You can update the FOV radius directly through the UI. Usage: Open UI: The menu will appear in the center of your screen upon execution. Enable Features: Click the buttons to toggle Aimbot, ESP, and Wallcheck. Adjust FOV: Click the FOV text box and type a number to change the size of your aiming radius. Combat: Hold Right Click while near an enemy to engage the aimbot. Summary This description highlights the professional GUI (CRAFT V2) and explains the technical aspects like smoothing and raycasting in a way that is attractive to users on script-sharing sites. It clearly defines the Right-Click requirement to prevent confusion during use.","tags":["Aimbot","ESP","GUI","teamcheck","wallcheck"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6a3847d49890b61b9003d78d","username":"CraftScripter","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"6a3847d49890b61b9003d78d","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"tota